                                                "sense_id": "8fa8f3dd-4649-3a18-875e-d45df17a7e83",
                                                "text": "He mounted its stairs and crossed the FDR to find the park transformed since he'd last seen it: There were sculpted bushes and a picturesque little bridge and joggers still out, even at this hour."
                                            }
